WEBVTT

15:31.081 --> 15:34.084
and bigger and bigger.

15:36.962 --> 15:39.381
There was Ghiscar

15:39.507 --> 15:41.967
and Valryon,

15:42.092 --> 15:43.802
Vermithrax,

15:43.928 --> 15:46.138
Essovius... (GASPS)

15:46.263 --> 15:48.682
...Archonei,

15:48.807 --> 15:52.102
Meraxes,

15:53.270 --> 15:55.147
Vhagar...

15:56.899 --> 15:59.860
- and Balerion the Dread...
- (MOANS)

15:59.985 --> 16:05.074
...whose fire forged
the Seven Kingdoms
